WEBVTT

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:30.045
is really calling to me
because it does look like a place ...

00:20:30.069 --> 00:20:32.324
AG: Before becoming
a social media influencer,

00:20:32.348 --> 00:20:36.377
she had an entirely different
decades-long career in social work.

00:20:36.401 --> 00:20:38.719
She was an expert
for New York City family courts

00:20:38.743 --> 00:20:40.116
on child abuse issues.

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:42.799
She wrote a seminal book
on social work and law,

00:20:42.823 --> 00:20:45.786
and she spent the last 20 years
as a professor of social work

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:47.762
at Fordham University.

00:20:47.786 --> 00:20:49.777
She was quite an authority in her field,

00:20:49.801 --> 00:20:53.813
but she told me she'd become frustrated
with the glacial pace of academia.

00:20:53.837 --> 00:20:57.062
Like, how long it takes to write
and publish journal articles.

00:20:57.086 --> 00:21:00.827
LS: The whole process
could take almost two years